  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Drain sweetcorn. Drain and rinse black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796d6ee183b5afa14503ecf-7301c914.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook carrot and black beans until tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Lightly smash beans with the back of a fork. Add Tex-Mex spice blend and corn and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Reduce heat to medium and stir in passata, the salt, brown sugar and the water. Cook until slightly thickened, 3-4 mins.\n• Remove from heat and add baby spinach and 1/2 the butter. Stir until wilted and combined.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796d6ee183b5afa14503ecf-bf5a11d3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve continental rolls. Toast or grill rolls to your liking.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave garlic and remaining butter in 10 second bursts, until melted and fragrant. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Brush garlic butter over rolls. Cut rolls into thick strips.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796d6ee183b5afa14503ecf-3854584d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide black bean-corn chilli between bowls.\n• Serve with garlic dippers. Top with a dollop of yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796d6ee183b5afa14503ecf-a4d6786d.jpeg"
    }
  ]
